Respect My Trims for Horizon 26.3 (version 0.4.0)

A port of Respect My Trims 1.0.0 by N (tnoctua).
Original source: https://github.com/tnoctua/respectmytrims
Original licence: LGPL-2.1-only

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: the rules are re-implemented in Rust as a Horizon native mod (the mod API plus
the [[native.mixin]] patches and game modules listed in horizon-mod.toml; no Java code is included), and the
content (items, blocks, textures, models, data) is carried over from the original jar. This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (LGPL-2.1-only); the licence text is in LICENSE. Built
against Horizon's exact-build SDK dd67b76ff23e28c6d8e21859df600d31572f81a0.

LICENSE is the original jar's LICENSE_respectmytrims.
